# Project rules

## Engineering standards

- Use strict TypeScript and keep changes small and focused.
- Never commit `.env` files or API keys.
- Run the relevant tests and build before completing changes.
- Match existing naming and module boundaries.

## Invariants

See `docs/INVARIANTS.md`. Key points:

- The Zod schema is the single source of truth for extracted data shape.
- `franc` is metadata-only and never translates or modifies LLM input.
- All LLM calls go through `src/services/invoice-extractor.ts`.
- The pipeline depends on interfaces in `src/ports/`, not concrete services.
- The domain layer has no LangChain imports.
